    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "Form an equation and solve.\n\nYolan buys 8 pens and receives 80 cents change from $\\$20.00$. How much does a pen cost, assuming each pen costs the same amount?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$2.40$ per pen.",
      "worked": "Let $c$ be the cost of one pen in dollars. The change is $\\$0.80$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}8c+0.80&=20.00\\\\8c&=19.20\\\\c&=2.40\\end{align*}$$\n\nEach pen costs $\\$2.40$.",
